notes:
Fixes the step-cap failure (was 19/20). One cell per student: packed*2^14 + (16384-id), 11-bit grade fields so AVG sums raw cells with LD+15xADD and subtracts a roster-time IDSUM. Tape 94 -> 32 slots. All three scans fully 16-way unrolled, because a ROM word costs ~10.5 ticks per operation on the closed ring, making an inner loop ~16x dearer than the straight-line code it saves. Worst legal cases (80 ops, N=16 K=4): TOP 3.36M, AVG 2.18M, GET 1.75M, all under the 5M cap.
